  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "u05_l1_g1",
      "pattern": "A-(으)ㄴ데요 / V-는데요 / N인데요",
      "meaning_uz": "Yumshoq gap: vaziyatni tushuntirib, javob kutish ('...-moqchi edim', '... edi')",
      "meaning_en": "Soft statement: explaining the situation and waiting for a reply ('I'd like to…', 'I was…')",
      "explanation_md": "**-(으)ㄴ데요 / -는데요** gapni **yumshatadi**: so'zlovchi vaziyatni tushuntiradi va suhbatdoshdan javob yoki yordam kutadi. O'zbekchada ko'pincha **\"...-moqchi edim\"**, **\"... edi\"** deb tarjima qilinadi.\n\n**통장을 만들고 싶은데요.** — *Hisob ochmoqchi edim.* (\"yordam bera olasizmi?\" degan ohang bilan)\n\n### Qachon ishlatiladi\n\n1. **Muloyim iltimos** (bank, do'kon, idorada): 환전하고 **싶은데요**.\n2. **Telefonda o'zini tanishtirish**: 여보세요? 저 아지즈**인데요**.\n3. **Yumshoq e'tiroz**: 이 신발은 좀 **작은데요**. — *Bu poyabzal biroz kichik ekan...*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n| Turi | Qo'shimcha | Misol |\n|---|---|---|\n| Sifat, 받침 yo'q | -ㄴ데요 | 비싸다 → **비싼데요** |\n| Sifat, 받침 bor | -은데요 | 작다 → **작은데요** |\n| -고 싶다 (sifatdek) | -은데요 | 만들고 싶다 → **만들고 싶은데요** |\n| Fe'l | -는데요 | 가다 → **가는데요** |\n| 있다 / 없다 | -는데요 | 없다 → **없는데요** |\n| Ot | 인데요 | 학생 → **학생인데요** |\n| O'tgan zamon | -았/었는데요 | 왔다 → **왔는데요** |\n\n2-bo'limdagi `-(으)ㄴ` (sifat) va 3-bo'limdagi `-는` (fe'l) qoidalari bilan bir xil!",
      "explanation_md_en": "**-(으)ㄴ데요 / -는데요** **softens** a sentence: the speaker explains the situation and expects a reply or some help. In English it often sounds like **\"I'd like to…\"**, **\"…, actually\"** or a sentence that trails off with **\"…\"**.\n\n**통장을 만들고 싶은데요.** — *I'd like to open an account.* (with the feeling \"could you help me?\")\n\n### When to use it\n\n1. **A polite request** (at a bank, shop, office): 환전하고 **싶은데요**.\n2. **Introducing yourself on the phone**: 여보세요? 저 아지즈**인데요**.\n3. **A soft objection**: 이 신발은 좀 **작은데요**. — *These shoes are a bit small, actually…*\n\n### How to form it\n\n| Type | Ending | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| Adjective, no 받침 | -ㄴ데요 | 비싸다 → **비싼데요** |\n| Adjective, with 받침 | -은데요 | 작다 → **작은데요** |\n| -고 싶다 (like an adjective) | -은데요 | 만들고 싶다 → **만들고 싶은데요** |\n| Verb | -는데요 | 가다 → **가는데요** |\n| 있다 / 없다 | -는데요 | 없다 → **없는데요** |\n| Noun | 인데요 | 학생 → **학생인데요** |\n| Past | -았/었는데요 | 왔다 → **왔는데요** |\n\nThe same rules as `-(으)ㄴ` (adjectives) in Unit 2 and `-는` (verbs) in Unit 3!",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "Sifat (va -고 싶다)",
          "condition_en": "Adjective (and -고 싶다)",
          "rule": "-(으)ㄴ데요",
          "example": "작다 → 작은데요, 싶다 → 싶은데요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Fe'l, 있다/없다",
          "condition_en": "Verb, 있다/없다",
          "rule": "-는데요",
          "example": "가다 → 가는데요, 없다 → 없는데요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Ot",
          "condition_en": "Noun",
          "rule": "N인데요",
          "example": "학생 → 학생인데요"
        }
      ],
